{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Arial;}}\f0\fs24 RecipeNest - Live Server Guide\par Open this folder in VS Code. Install Live Server by Ritwick Dey. Right-click index.html and choose Open with Live Server. No application backend or service key is required.\par Recipes, calculator, favourites, weekly planner, gallery and six languages run in the browser. The chat uses local recipe data.\par Open tests/browser.html with Live Server to run browser checks. See README.md for details.}